# Design source art — both files are over GitHub's 100 MB hard limit and are
# working files, not deliverables. Keep them in shared storage. The site ships
# the derivatives generated from them (codebase/public/images), and
# `npm run imagery` regenerates those from the originals.
DOA-APRU-Design-21Aug.ai
DOA-APRU-MainImage.jpg

# Scratch
_claude_tmp/

